      "text": [
        "هِ فَقَالَتِ اِمْرَأَةٌ رَفِيقَةٌ لَهُمُ اِجْعَلُوا لِي مِنْهُ بِدِرْهَمٍ فَجَعَلُوا لَهَا فَقَالَ «عَلَى كُلِّ إِنْسَانٍ مِنْهُمْ شَاةٌ »."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.2738 - Abu Basir asked Abu Abdullah (as) about a group of people in the state of ihram who purchased game and shared it among themselves. A woman who was their companion said, \"Give me a portion of it for one dirham,\" and they did so.\nImam (as) said: \"Each of them must offer a sheep as expiation.\""
        ]
      }
